---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import GithubActivity from "../../components/GithubActivity.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Elkis Daza Mota"
  description="Product engineer. Twelve months of real engineering, eight years of WordPress before that. The code is the medium — not the identity."
>
  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="ab-hero">
    <div class="container ab-hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="ebar"></span>
        <span data-en>/ About</span><span data-es>/ About</span>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <b>Elkis Daza Mota</b>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <span>Santiago, Chile</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="ab-title">
        <span data-en>I see problems where others see normal.</span>
        <span data-es>Veo problemas donde otros ven situaciones normales.</span>
        <span class="l2">
          <span data-en>Then I <span class="ac">build the fix.</span></span>
          <span data-es>Y construyo <span class="ac">la solución.</span></span>
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="ab-lede">
        <span data-en>
          Product engineer. Colombian-Venezuelan, based in Santiago.
          <b>Twelve months of real engineering</b>, eight years of WordPress before
          that. The code is the medium — not the identity.
        </span>
        <span data-es>
          Product engineer. Colombo-venezolano, en Santiago. <b>Doce meses de
          ingeniería real</b>, ocho años de WordPress antes. El código es el medio —
          no la identidad.
        </span>
      </p>
      <div class="ab-meta">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="l" data-en>Started coding</div><div class="l" data-es>Empecé a programar</div>
          <div class="v">May 29, 2025</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="l" data-en>Currently</div><div class="l" data-es>Actualmente</div>
          <div class="v">Tech lead · Capital Inteligente</div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="l" data-en>Open to</div><div class="l" data-es>Abierto a</div>
          <div class="v">
            <span data-en>Remote · US / EU · Q3 2026</span>
            <span data-es>Remoto · US / EU · Q3 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ STORY ARC ============ -->
  <section class="ab-scope">
    <div class="ab-prose">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="ebar"></span>
          <span data-en>/ Where I started</span><span data-es>/ De dónde vengo</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span data-en>Eight years of building the wrong thing.</span>
          <span data-es>Ocho años construyendo lo equivocado.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="story">
        <div class="year-marker">
          <span data-en>2017 — 2025</span><span data-es>2017 — 2025</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <b data-en>The drag</b><b data-es>El arrastre</b>
        </div>

        <p data-en>I built WordPress sites for almost a decade. Divi, Elementor, page builders. I was good at it — fast, accurate, clients paid on time. But every project felt the same. Every "platform" was a wrapper around someone else's CMS. I was operating a CMS, not engineering anything.</p>
        <p data-es>Construí sitios de WordPress por casi una década. Divi, Elementor, page builders. Era bueno — rápido, prolijo, los clientes pagaban a tiempo. Pero cada proyecto se sentía igual. Cada "plataforma" era un wrapper sobre el CMS de otro. Yo operaba un CMS, no construía ingeniería.</p>

        <p data-en>By 2024 I had a recurring thought: <b>"Whatever this is, it's not what I want to do for the next ten years."</b> I'd watch teams ship real software — APIs, schemas, deploys — and feel the gap. I was a power user pretending to be a builder.</p>
        <p data-es>Para 2024 tenía un pensamiento recurrente: <b>"Sea lo que sea esto, no es lo que quiero hacer los próximos diez años."</b> Veía equipos shippeando software real — APIs, schemas, deploys — y sentía la brecha. Era un power user pretendiendo ser builder.</p>

        <div class="year-marker">
          <span data-en>May 29, 2025</span><span data-es>29 mayo 2025</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <b data-en>Day 0</b><b data-es>Día 0</b>
        </div>

        <p data-en>I cleared my laptop. Uninstalled Divi. Opened a JavaScript tutorial at 8am. By midnight I'd written my first <code class="inline-code">function</code> from scratch — three lines, returned a string. Trivial. <b>But it was mine.</b></p>
        <p data-es>Limpié el laptop. Desinstalé Divi. Abrí un tutorial de JavaScript a las 8am. A medianoche había escrito mi primera <code class="inline-code">function</code> desde cero — tres líneas, devolvía un string. Trivial. <b>Pero era mía.</b></p>

        <p data-en>The next morning I committed it. Then I committed every day after. That habit — show up daily, even with garbage — is the only thing that worked. Not bootcamps, not videos, not "thirty days to learn React." Just: ship something every day. Even when it's broken. Especially when it's broken.</p>
        <p data-es>A la mañana siguiente la commiteé. Y commiteé todos los días después. Ese hábito — aparecer a diario, incluso con basura — es lo único que funcionó. No bootcamps, no videos, no "treinta días para aprender React." Solo: shippear algo todos los días. Incluso cuando está roto. Sobre todo cuando está roto.</p>

        <div class="year-marker">
          <span data-en>Sep 2025 — now</span><span data-es>Sep 2025 — ahora</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <b data-en>The compounding</b><b data-es>El interés compuesto</b>
        </div>

        <p data-en>Three months in, Capital Inteligente took a chance on me. Six months in, I owned the internal CRM. Twelve months in, I'm tech lead in everything but title. Architecture decisions, hiring input, code review, the WhatsApp inbox AI that lives in production.</p>
        <p data-es>A los tres meses, Capital Inteligente apostó por mí. A los seis, era dueño del CRM interno. A los doce, soy tech lead en todo menos en el título. Decisiones de arquitectura, input en contrataciones, code review, el WhatsApp inbox AI que vive en producción.</p>

        <p data-en>The shortcut wasn't talent. It was a stack of compounding choices: boring tech, daily commits, AI agents under engineering discipline, and a deep refusal to vibe-code anything I'd ship. <b>Speed plus craft, every day, for a year.</b></p>
        <p data-es>El atajo no fue talento. Fue una pila de decisiones que componen: tech aburrido, commits diarios, agentes de IA con disciplina de ingeniería, y una negativa profunda a vibe-codear nada que fuera a shippear. <b>Velocidad más oficio, todos los días, por un año.</b></p>
      </div>

      <!-- pull quote -->
      <div class="pullquote">
        <p class="q">
          <span data-en>I'm not a dev <span class="ac">with</span> AI.<br />I <span class="ac">run</span> the system.</span>
          <span data-es>No soy un dev <span class="ac">con</span> IA.<br />Yo <span class="ac">corro</span> el sistema.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="attrib">
          — <span data-en>written on my whiteboard, week 4</span><span data-es>escrito en mi pizarra, semana 4</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ WHAT I DO ============ -->
  <section class="ab-scope">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="ebar"></span>
          <span data-en>/ What I actually do</span><span data-es>/ Qué hago en realidad</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span data-en>Three jobs. <span class="muted">Same person.</span></span>
          <span data-es>Tres trabajos. <span class="muted">La misma persona.</span></span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="doing-grid">
        <div class="doing-col">
          <div class="lead">01<span class="ac">.</span></div>
          <h3 data-en>Build CRMs that actually ship.</h3>
          <h3 data-es>CRMs que efectivamente shippean.</h3>
          <p data-en>End-to-end: schema, API, UI, deploys, on-call. The kind agents actually open every morning — not the one PMs demo and then no one logs into.</p>
          <p data-es>End-to-end: schema, API, UI, deploys, on-call. El tipo que los agentes abren todas las mañanas — no el que los PMs demuestran y nadie usa.</p>
          <div class="examples">
            <b>→</b> Capital Inteligente CRM ·<br />
            <b>→</b> Factibilidad cache (60d TTL) ·<br />
            <b>→</b> Internal admin platform ·
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="doing-col">
          <div class="lead">02<span class="ac">.</span></div>
          <h3 data-en>Orchestrate AI like a team.</h3>
          <h3 data-es>Orquesto IA como un equipo.</h3>
          <p data-en>Claude Code, Cursor, Codex. Each gets a scoped task and a review gate. I'm the architect; they're the executors. Discipline keeps the speed honest.</p>
          <p data-es>Claude Code, Cursor, Codex. Cada uno con tarea acotada y gate de review. Yo soy el arquitecto; ellos los ejecutores. La disciplina mantiene la velocidad honesta.</p>
          <div class="examples">
            <b>→</b> Scoped prompts, no vibe-coding ·<br />
            <b>→</b> Test-gated PRs ·<br />
            <b>→</b> Prompt versioning (v2) ·
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="doing-col">
          <div class="lead">03<span class="ac">.</span></div>
          <h3 data-en>Translate business → system.</h3>
          <h3 data-es>Traduzco negocio → sistema.</h3>
          <p data-en>Sit with the agents. Watch them work. Find the four-hour bottleneck. Design the schema that kills it. Most "engineering" problems are actually misframed business problems.</p>
          <p data-es>Me siento con los agentes. Los miro trabajar. Encuentro el cuello de botella de cuatro horas. Diseño el schema que lo mata. Casi todo "problema de ingeniería" es un problema de negocio mal encuadrado.</p>
          <div class="examples">
            <b>→</b> Lead Scoring Engine ·<br />
            <b>→</b> WhatsApp Inbox AI ·<br />
            <b>→</b> Agent throughput +3× ·
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ VALUES ============ -->
  <section class="ab-scope">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="ebar"></span>
          <span data-en>/ What I value</span><span data-es>/ Qué valoro</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span data-en>Five principles. <span class="muted">Non-negotiable.</span></span>
          <span data-es>Cinco principios. <span class="muted">No negociables.</span></span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="values">
        <div class="value">
          <div class="num">01<span class="small">.</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3 class="statement">
              <span data-en>Boring <span class="ac">stack.</span></span>
              <span data-es>Stack <span class="ac">aburrido.</span></span>
            </h3>
            <p class="explain">
              <span data-en>TypeScript, Postgres, Astro. Durable beats clever. <b>Boring code lives ten years; clever code lives until the original author leaves.</b></span>
              <span data-es>TypeScript, Postgres, Astro. Durable le gana a clever. <b>El código aburrido vive diez años; el clever vive hasta que se va su autor.</b></span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="value">
          <div class="num">02<span class="small">.</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3 class="statement">
              <span data-en>Show the <span class="ac">work.</span></span>
              <span data-es>Mostrar el <span class="ac">trabajo.</span></span>
            </h3>
            <p class="explain">
              <span data-en>4,127 commits, 36 repos, three CRMs in production. <b>Every claim measurable. Every metric reproducible.</b> No "I built it" without a link.</span>
              <span data-es>4,127 commits, 36 repos, tres CRMs en producción. <b>Cada afirmación medible. Cada métrica reproducible.</b> No hay "yo lo construí" sin link.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="value">
          <div class="num">03<span class="small">.</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3 class="statement">
              <span data-en>Honest <span class="ac">metrics.</span></span>
              <span data-es>Métricas <span class="ac">honestas.</span></span>
            </h3>
            <p class="explain">
              <span data-en>Conversion lift, p95 latency, dollars saved. Vanity gets fired. <b>If you can't show a baseline, you don't have a metric — you have a feeling.</b></span>
              <span data-es>Lift de conversión, latencia p95, dólares ahorrados. La vanidad se despide. <b>Si no muestras un baseline, no tienes una métrica — tienes un sentimiento.</b></span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="value">
          <div class="num">04<span class="small">.</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3 class="statement">
              <span data-en>Speed <span class="ac">compounds.</span></span>
              <span data-es>La velocidad <span class="ac">compone.</span></span>
            </h3>
            <p class="explain">
              <span data-en>Daily commits. Weekly demos. Two-week sprints. <b>A year of small daily wins beats six months of "the big rewrite."</b> Compounding is the only superpower.</span>
              <span data-es>Commits diarios. Demos semanales. Sprints de dos semanas. <b>Un año de pequeños wins diarios le gana a seis meses del "gran rewrite".</b> El interés compuesto es la única superpotencia.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="value">
          <div class="num">05<span class="small">.</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <h3 class="statement">
              <span data-en>Architect, <span class="ac">not vibe-coder.</span></span>
              <span data-es>Arquitecto, <span class="ac">no vibe-coder.</span></span>
            </h3>
            <p class="explain">
              <span data-en>I run the AI. The AI doesn't run me. <b>Every line that ships passed through a decision I made — scoped, reviewed, tested.</b> Speed only works with rails.</span>
              <span data-es>Yo corro la IA. La IA no me corre a mí. <b>Cada línea que shippea pasó por una decisión mía — scoped, reviewed, tested.</b> La velocidad solo funciona con rieles.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CURRENTLY ============ -->
  <section class="ab-scope">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="ebar"></span>
          <span data-en>/ Currently</span><span data-es>/ Ahora mismo</span>
          <span class="sep"></span>
          <span data-en>A <b>/now</b> page, Sivers-style</span>
          <span data-es>Una <b>/now</b> page, estilo Sivers</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span data-en>What I'm working on. <span class="muted">Today.</span></span>
          <span data-es>En qué estoy. <span class="muted">Hoy.</span></span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="currently">
        <div class="head">
          <div class="live" data-en>Status · Live</div>
          <div class="live" data-es>Status · En vivo</div>
          <div class="stamp">
            <span data-en>Last updated </span><span data-es>Última actualización </span>
            <b>May 27, 2026</b>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <div>
              <span data-en>Building <b>Lead Scoring Engine v2</b> — prompt versioning, human-in-the-loop feedback, coverage-feed scraper.</span>
              <span data-es>Construyendo <b>Lead Scoring Engine v2</b> — versionado de prompts, human-in-the-loop, scraper de coverage feeds.</span>
              <div class="meta" data-en>Capital Inteligente · 60% done</div>
              <div class="meta" data-es>Capital Inteligente · 60% hecho</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <span data-en>Writing about <b>AI-orchestrated production codebases</b> — what works, what burns hours, what discipline holds it together.</span>
              <span data-es>Escribiendo sobre <b>codebases productivos orquestados por IA</b> — qué funciona, qué quema horas, qué disciplina lo sostiene.</span>
              <div class="meta" data-en>First post live on /blog</div>
              <div class="meta" data-es>Primer post publicado en /blog</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <span data-en>Open to <b>one new project</b> starting Q3 2026 — remote US/EU, product engineering + AI orchestration.</span>
              <span data-es>Abierto a <b>un proyecto nuevo</b> empezando Q3 2026 — remoto US/EU, product engineering + orquestación de IA.</span>
              <div class="meta" data-en>Brief me at hello@elkis.dev</div>
              <div class="meta" data-es>Mándame un brief a hello@elkis.dev</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ COMMIT RHYTHM ============ -->
  <section class="ab-scope">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="ebar"></span>
          <span data-en>/ The commit rhythm</span>
          <span data-es>/ El ritmo de commits</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);">
          <span data-en>Daily commits. Compounding.</span>
          <span data-es>Commits diarios. Componiendo.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <GithubActivity />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ STACK ============ -->
  <section class="ab-scope">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="ebar"></span>
          <span data-en>/ Stack</span><span data-es>/ Stack</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span data-en>The tools, daily.</span>
          <span data-es>Las herramientas, a diario.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-grid">
        <div class="stack-group">
          <div class="gtitle">EDITOR & RUNTIME · <b>2025—</b></div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Cursor</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>primary · best agent integration</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>primary · mejor integración de agente</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Zed</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>secondary · when I need to think alone</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>secondary · cuando necesito pensar solo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">pnpm</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>faster, stricter than npm</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>más rápido y estricto que npm</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Bun</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>for scripts & serverless tests</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>para scripts y tests serverless</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-group">
          <div class="gtitle">FRAMEWORK · <b>delivery layer</b></div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Astro 5</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>marketing & content sites</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>sitios marketing y contenido</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Next.js 16</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>CRMs & dashboards</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>CRMs y dashboards</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">React 19</span>
              <span class="why">RSC + suspense</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Tailwind 4</span>
              <span class="why">tokens-first</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">shadcn/ui</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>copy-paste components</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>componentes copy-paste</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-group">
          <div class="gtitle">DATA · <b>where the truth lives</b></div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Postgres</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>the only DB I'd defend in a fight</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>la única DB que defendería en pelea</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Supabase</span>
              <span class="why">postgres + auth + edge</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Drizzle</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>typed, no magic</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>typed, sin magia</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Upstash Redis</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>cache & rate limits</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>cache y rate limits</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-group">
          <div class="gtitle">AI · <b>under discipline</b></div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Claude Code</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>long-context refactors</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>refactors de largo contexto</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Cursor agents</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>scoped IDE tasks</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>tareas IDE acotadas</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">GPT-4o-mini</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>classification at scale</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>clasificación a escala</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Whisper</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>voice → text in WhatsApp</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>voz → texto en WhatsApp</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-group">
          <div class="gtitle">HOSTING · <b>boring &amp; fast</b></div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Vercel</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>Next.js, edge functions, preview deploys</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>Next.js, edge functions, preview deploys</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Cloudflare</span>
              <span class="why">DNS · WAF · R2</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Supabase</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>db + auth + storage</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>db + auth + storage</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Resend</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>transactional email</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>email transaccional</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-group">
          <div class="gtitle">DAILY · <b>workflow</b></div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Linear</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>issues &amp; cycles</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>issues y ciclos</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-item">
              <span class="name">Raycast</span>
              <span class="why" data-en>my launcher · my snippets</span>
              <span class="why" data-es>mi launcher · mis snippets</span>
            </div>
